abstract: "Public reproducibility package and audit-trail atlas for a multi-route research programme toward the Riemann Hypothesis. The repository documents conditional reductions, explored routes, failed paths, obstruction analysis, public scripts, certificate outputs, and the separately published Even-Dominance companion record."
